		(descr "Tantalum capacitor, EIA-3216-18 (Kemet A). EXTRACTED FROM THE BOARD, deliberately: the upstream KiCad Capacitor_Tantalum_SMD:CP_EIA-3216-18_Kemet-A footprint has since grown by ~0.05 mm, which is enough to cause clearance violations against the routing already on these boards, so the stock library is NOT a drop-in replacement. This is the as-built v3.2 geometry, verified identical across all 135 instances on the four boards (split72 left/right, split42 left/right). NOTE: kept on B.Cu - every instance on every board is bottom-mounted, so there is no front-side instance to copy and converting would mean a front/back mirror with no reference to verify against. Do not 'update' this from the stock library without re-running DRC.")
